### Practical 13: AI API Integration & Responsible AI
### REST Client Test Suite

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Root Metadata & AI Subsystem Verification
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. AI Subsystem Status & Rate Limit Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/status
Accept: application/json

### 3. Generate Task Description (Happy Path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/generate-description
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement Docker Compose Multi-Container Orchestration",
  "priority": "high",
  "skipRateLimit": true
}

### 4. Test Graceful Degradation (Simulated Offline / Invalid Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/generate-description
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Configure GitHub Actions CI/CD Pipeline",
  "priority": "medium",
  "forceFailure": true
}

### 5. Suggest Priority Based on Task Title & Description
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/suggest-priority
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix Critical Security Authentication Vulnerability in Production",
  "description": "JWT tokens expiring improperly or weak bcrypt salt"
}

### 6. Suggest Actionable Subtasks Breakdown
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/suggest-subtasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Containerize Full-Stack App with Docker"
}

### 7. Test Rate Limit Enforcement (Execute Twice Rapidly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/generate-description
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rapid Fire Test Request 1"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/generate-description
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rapid Fire Test Request 2"
}
